  "question": {
    "text": "For a periodic motion represented by the equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>sin&#969;</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>cos&#969;</mi><mi>t</mi></math> the amplitude of the motion is",
